    "input": "How do I open a savings account?",
    "started_at": "2026-11-19T07:12:54.661058+00:00",
    "output": "To open a new savings account at VinBank, you can choose one of these options:\n\n1. **Online Application** – Visit our website or use the mobile app to start the application process. You’ll need to provide your personal details, proof of address (like a utility bill), and income verification documents.\n2. **In-Person Appointment** – Stop by any VinBank branch with your identification and documentation ready.\n3. **Phone Assistance** – Call our dedicated customer service line for real-time help and instant answers.\n\nOnce submitted, we’ll review your information and confirm the account setup. Please note that certain accounts may require a minimum balance or monthly fees—details vary by product, so check our account types page or ask during the application.\n\nFor step-by-step instructions tailored to your situation, feel free to share more about what you’re looking for (e.g., interest rate, features).",
